  "adaptations": [
    "Selected original authored Anthurium variants a,b,c, Fern 02 variants b,c,a, and Pachira variants c,b,d (excluded nursery-braided a).",
    "Applied one original Anthurium subdivision/displacement pass; decimated only as needed for the mobile budget.",
    "Baked original scene layout offsets into individually ground-centred metre-scale meshes.",
    "Generated lower-detail meshes via collapse decimation, keeping UVs and professional photographic maps.",
    "Converted source maps to web PNG alpha and JPEG normal/roughness formats during Blender glTF export. No photographic pixel repainting.",
    "Set glTF foliage materials to alpha MASK=0.5 with double-sided leaves; bark remains opaque.",
    "CanopySpray is a simplified professional Pachira b leaf cluster with its trunk excluded."
  ],
